      en: ["Headquarters of the Pryluky Regiment in the 17th C.", "Crucial defense point against Tatar invasions", "Originally built with earthen ramparts and wood", "Includes the historic Transfiguration Cathedral", "Lost strategic value as the Russian Empire grew", "Large earthen ramparts are still visible today"],
